    narr:narration """The trajectory of [decision capture](narr:Position_CoreFeatureDecisionCapture) has evolved from a March 2026 conceptual mandate into a series of August 2026 technical and operational milestones. The narrative now centers on the [shipment of the async decision widget](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1785578557516_1), which serves as the primary evidence for the product's differentiation. This technical delivery is linked to a [Zephyr integration](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1785578557516_3), framed as the essential unlock for team performance. Alongside these technical markers, the [sprint outcomes](narr:Position_Sprint4OutcomeAndDriver) are substantiated by a [record-high velocity](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1785578557516_2), grounding the abstract goal of consensus-based capture in measurable, quarter-end performance metrics.""" ;
